      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我既然身为一流的赛马娘，\n就应该向三冠路线迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0284bdcc5d7433f4839218795a70e83a046ef469f859860c02cbea3739d1acf2",
