      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……毕竟运动员能闪闪发光的时间，\n是短暂且无可替代的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5c29013dc6f00ec12fd61a3b845f45dc37a0867b1097d41a51940c7039eb49",
